{
  "$schema_note": "CUDA pack manifest for Windows x64. Downloaded by the app at run time (never by CI) into <app support>/cuda_pack/. Generated 2026-11-18 after microsoft/onnxruntime disappeared from GitHub (issue #7): ONNX Runtime now comes from its NuGet package, which is a CUDA 13 build, so the NVIDIA libraries are the CUDA 13 wheels. All sha256 verified (nupkg downloaded and hashed, members hashed after extraction; wheel hashes are PyPI's published digests, wheel contents listed from the zip central directories).",
